\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-end\-time <int64>\fR
\&Filter runs ending at or before this Unix timestamp in milliseconds
\&Default: \(dq0\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-event <string>\fR
\&Filter by event: mr, push, manual
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
\&Output workflow runs as JSON
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-L, \-\-limit <int>\fR
\&Maximum number of runs to list
\&Default: \(dq30\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-pr <string>\fR
\&Filter by pull request number
